    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1067475655",
      "Source": "Dodorex Boss Summoner",
      "Trans": {"SC":"渡渡霸王龙BOSS召唤物","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4230850054",
      "Source": "Use this item in your dinos inventory, then kill wild creatures to draw the attention of the Dodorex.When sufficiently angered, it will appear.<#RN#>The buff icon will show the progress.<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1, 0.65, 0, 1\">Ancient Dodorex appears only when u defeat the Ex-Dodorex during the day with temperatures exceeding 40℃</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将此物品放在恐龙背包内，击杀野生生物来吸引渡渡霸王龙的注意。积累足够怒气后它将会现身。<#RN#> 增益图标会显示进度。<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1, 0.65, 0, 1\">远古渡渡霸王龙仅可在白天、气温超过 40℃的条件下，击败Ex渡渡霸王龙后才会出现 </>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
